      "text": "CORAM: HON'BLE MR JUSTICE M.NAGAPRASANNA  -3-  NC: 2024:KHC:32615  CRL.P No. 10654 of 2022  ORAL ORDER The co-ordinate Bench of this Court, on 24.01.2024 had passed a peremptory order, which reads as follows:\n\"One week's time granted for removing office objections finally, failing which, the petition shall sand dismissed for default.\"",
